The Delaware S[PC]A is[ dedicated] to the prevention of cruelty and the encouragement of humane treatment of all animals. Established in 1873, Delaware S[PC]A is the oldest animal welfare organization in the state and has provided continuous service to pets and their companions for more than 135[ years].
Faithful Friends Animal Society is a private animal welfare organization with a No Kill shelter. We[ are] funded through private[ donations], grants, fees for services and special[ fundra]isers[ held throughout] the year. All cats and dogs in our care stay with us until homes are found.

